    "detailed_description": "Have you ever wanted to roll an oil drum?<br>Roll the drum as far as you want with Drum Roll\uff01<br><br>Manta Studio permits monetization of this game through video and live streaming.<br><br>Aim for the goal with simple actions.<br>There are various challenging sections in the game, such as winding paths and steep slopes.<br>Use your concentration, reflexes, and unbreakable heart to keep the drum rolling and beat your personal best time.<br><br><strong>To clear the game</strong>.<br><br>The game is cleared when the drum can is placed upright in the white luminous circle within the time limit!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414600/extras/336594aa361fe93eacbdb199cd32693e.poster.avif?t=1697706095\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414600/extras/336594aa361fe93eacbdb199cd32693e.webm?t=1697706095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414600/extras/336594aa361fe93eacbdb199cd32693e.mp4?t=1697706095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>If the time limit is unceremoniously exceeded, the drum will explode.<br>In addition, there is a self-destruct command, so you can always reset it by self-destructing if you think you cannot reach the goal!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414600/extras/1ea2107795e0036baab658d6b25fc8d5.poster.avif?t=1697706095\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414600/extras/1ea2107795e0036baab658d6b25fc8d5.webm?t=1697706095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414600/extras/1ea2107795e0036baab658d6b25fc8d5.mp4?t=1697706095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Main Features</strong>.<br>\u30fbThere are six outdoor stages in total, which may make you feel like a little traveler!<br>\u30fbSimple action of rolling weakly and rolling strongly<br>\u30fbSparks fly out when the drum makes contact with the ground while it is spinning at high speed",
