706095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Main Features</strong>.<br>\u30fbThere are six outdoor stages in total, which may make you feel like a little traveler!<br>\u30fbSimple action of rolling weakly and rolling strongly<br>\u30fbSparks fly out when the drum makes contact with the ground while it is spinning at high speed",
